{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25139","headline":"仲夏寄江南 · 卢殷","name":"仲夏寄江南","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"五月行将近，三年客未回。\n梦成千里去，酒醒百忧来。\n晚暮时看槿，悲酸不食梅。\n空将白团扇，从寄复裴回。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"卢殷","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_25139.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25139","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}